---
InheritParentConfig: true
# Catch2-specific false positives:
#  - bugprone-chained-comparison: CHECK(a == b) expands to `Catch::Decomposer() <= a == b`.
#  - bugprone-unchecked-optional-access: the check does not know REQUIRE(opt.has_value()) aborts.
#  - clang-analyzer-optin.core.EnumCastOutOfRange: Catch2's ResultDisposition::Flags is a bitmask
#    enum; its operator| legitimately produces combined values.
# Test-fixture choices:
#  - bugprone-throwing-static-initialization / cert-err58-cpp: test-wide constant OIDs are
#    globals; a bad literal fails the test binary at start-up, which is what we want.
Checks: >
  -bugprone-chained-comparison,
  -bugprone-unchecked-optional-access,
  -bugprone-throwing-static-initialization,
  -cert-err58-cpp,
  -clang-analyzer-optin.core.EnumCastOutOfRange
...
